ARRAYS:
------------
  ->Arrays are the linear data structures used to store homogeneous(same type of data) or heterogeneous(different types of data) types of data
  ->Array size is not fixed.


Ways to declare array:
---------------------------
   1.1.Literal ways
   2.Using new keyword (array Object)

Functions/methods:
--------------------------
  ->Functions is the block of statements which will get execute whenever we called or invoke function.
  ->Using functions we can increase code reusablity and code reusablity.

  ->basically we have 2 type functions:
       1.User define functions-
            ->Any function that is declared by user/programmer as per their requirement.
       2.predefine functions-
            ->Predefine functions are inbuilt functions 



Function Types:
-------------------

   1.Anonymous function
   2.normal function/named function
   3.Functional Expression
   4.Immediate invoking function/self calling function
   5.Arrow function
   6.Nested function
   7.Higher order function
   8.callback function
   9.generator function


